031 "Dividing Polynomials Using Long Division" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050117 #edb/ref 1033 427 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050117 #edb/ref 1035 #uuid "2e70a953-3c7e-56c2-ab7b-ae151e69a396" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050843 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186048116 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050843 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186048649 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050843 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186049181 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050843 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186049341 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050843 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186049478 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050843 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186049502 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050843 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186049689 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050843 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186050076 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050843 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186050282 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050843 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186050383 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050843 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186054690 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050843 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186054691 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050843 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186054767 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050843 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186054768 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050843 #edb/ref 1031 "Simplifying Rational Expressions" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050843 #edb/ref 1033 68 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050843 #edb/ref 1035 #uuid "6ae775b6-8adc-58c2-abd8-8374a1314249" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186128930 #edb/ref 1069 "e-5032" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186128930 #edb/ref 1071 "From top to bottom, what are the missing expressions in the following polynomial division problem?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{\\text{[math]\\phantom{2x+20}[/math]}} \\\\  & x-4\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,2{x}^{2}+12x+25\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2{x}^{2}-\\,\\,8x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{\\text{[math]\\phantom{20x+25}[/math]}} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{20x-80}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,105 \\\\  & \\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186128930 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "2b2f2b8e-4625-5550-bb37-5ab9ca409c50" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186128930 #edb/ref 1074 "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x+20 \\\\  & x-4\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,2{x}^{2}+12x+25\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2{x}^{2}-\\,\\,8x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,20x+25 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{20x-80}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,105 \\\\  & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the missing expressions are $2x+20$ and $20x+25.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186128931 #edb/ref 1069 "e-5033" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186128931 #edb/ref 1071 "From top to bottom, what are the missing expressions in the following polynomial division problem?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{\\text{[math]\\phantom{x^2 - x + 1}[/math]}} \\\\  & x+1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x+64\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,{x}^{2}+0x+64 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,{x}^{2}-x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{\\text{[math]\\phantom{x + 64}[/math]}} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x+1}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,63\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186128931 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "bda2e91a-5b55-5deb-8232-7e79fabf6f29" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186128931 #edb/ref 1074 "Notice that the dividend is missing the $x^2$-term and the $x$-term. So, we write it using zero coefficients, as follows:\n\n$$\nx^3+{\\color{red}0}x^2 + {\\color{red}0}x + 64\n$$\n\nUsing the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{2}-x+1 \\\\  & x+1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x+64\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,{x}^{2}+0x+64 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,{x}^{2}-x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,x+64 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x+1}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,63\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the missing expressions are\n\n$\\qquad$ $x^2 - x + 1\\quad$ and $\\quad x + 64.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186128933 #edb/ref 1069 "e-5110" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186128933 #edb/ref 1071 "Consider the following polynomial division:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x-2 \\\\  & x+5\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,2{x}^{2}+\\phantom{1}8x-\\phantom{1}5\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2{x}^{2}+10x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2x-5 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-2x-10}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the above, what is $\\dfrac{2x^2+8x-5}{x+5}?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186128933 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "e3e171d1-4428-5a4d-a050-5ad8eb843aff" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186128933 #edb/ref 1074 "$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x-2 \\\\  & x+5\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,2{x}^{2}+\\phantom{1}8x-\\phantom{1}5\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2{x}^{2}+10x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2x-5 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-2x-10}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the given polynomial division, we deduce that dividing the polynomial $2x^2+8x -5$ by the linear binomial ${\\color{purple}x+5}$ gives\n\n- the quotient ${\\color{blue}2x-2},$ and\n\n- the remainder ${\\color{red}5}.$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{2x^2+8x-5}{x+5} = {\\color{blue}2x-2}+\\dfrac{\\color{red}5}{\\color{purple}x+5}.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129117 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186048422 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129117 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186048806 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129117 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186050843 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129117 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186129404 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129117 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186129405 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129117 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186241083 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129117 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186323952 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129117 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399482 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129117 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399809 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129117 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186476881 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129117 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186476896 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129117 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186476899 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129117 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186476938 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129117 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186476955 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129117 #edb/ref 1039 "Dividing a Polynomial by a Linear Binomial" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129117 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186128930 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129117 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "dd4abd5d-2642-5f0d-af2f-5ed5c265526a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129118 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186129408 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129118 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186129409 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129118 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186250216 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129118 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186323963 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129118 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186399823 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129118 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186402602 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129118 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186476894 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186129118 #edb/ref 1038 